<tr height="50" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr height="300" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r2" locked="0" aEditID="c1r2" >
<![CDATA[<div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your inquiry about our BS Integrative Health degree program.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">As the face of healthcare continues to change across a national and global scale, it is important for educational institutions to prepare students for the future of health and wellness. The College of Nursing and Health Innovation aims to prepare lifelong, dynamic learners who are able to adapt and overcome complex challenges involved with health.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">The BS Integrative Health is a new undergraduate degree focused on integrative and holistic health providing students with a broader perspective of treatment using approaches from allopathic and complementary medicine to elicit the best health outcomes.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">The BS Integrative Health provides a foundation in integrative health, a holistic approach to wellness that focuses on the mind, body, and spirit. The program provides students with a foundation of innovative and interprofessional approaches to serving and supporting diverse populations. Students will learn to differentiate the ethics, legalities, and standards of practice of integrative health and to think critically about different therapies, modalities and practitioners. Coursework and experiences include an emphasis on research and evidence-based practices and gaining an understanding of the historical and cultural foundations of the integrative health field.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Graduates will be qualified for careers in many areas of the integrative health field including hospitals, physician’s offices, wellness and fitness centers, and holistic health centers.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Program Requirements</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">To view the BS&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">Integrative Health</span><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">&nbsp;degree requirements and submit an application click&nbsp;</font><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/majorinfo/ASU00/NUIHLTBS/undergrad/false" target="_blank" style="font-size: medium;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">here</font></a><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">Our BS&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">Integrative Health</span><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">&nbsp;program is available on the&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: arial;"><a href="https://campus.asu.edu/downtown/" target="_blank" style="font-size: medium;">Downtown Phoenix campus</a>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;</font><a href="https://campus.asu.edu/west/" target="_blank" style="font-family: arial; font-size: medium;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">West campus</font></a><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font face="arial">. </font></font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">The plan of study for the campus based program can be found&nbsp;</font></font><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/roadmaps/ASU00/NUIHLTBS/null/ALL/2015" target="_blank" style="font-family: arial;">here</a><font face="arial">.&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">To view the plan of study for the online program, please&nbsp;</font>click&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: medium;"><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/roadmaps/ASU00/NUIHLTBS/null/ONLINE/2015" target="_blank">here</a>.</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</font><font style="font-size: 12pt;">The c</font><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">ourse descriptions are hyperlinked within the major maps.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Benefits of pursuing a degree with ASU</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li>Growing your career and leading others</li><li>Gaining broader perspectives on integrative health approaches and practices</li><li>Surrounding yourself with expert faculty and quality mentors</li><li>Preparing to positively impact health outcomes</li><li>Applying theory and research to practice</li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Contact us to get started!</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr height="50" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r3" locked="0" aEditID="c1r3" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Recruitment and Admissions</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">College of Nursing and Health Innovation</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Phone: (602) 496-0937</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Office Hours: Monday - Friday, 8a.m. - 5p.m.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">conhi_undergrad@asu.edu</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://nursingandhealth.asu.edu">https://nursingandhealth.asu.edu</a><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><font face="arial" size="1" color="#cccccc">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div>]]></td>
